                <head>Enclosure</head>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Korea</hi>
                </p>
                <p>It is recommended that the President discuss with Mr. Attlee the following course
                    of action with respect to Korea: <list>
                        <label>1.</label>
                        <item>Inform Mr. Attlee of the military situation confronting United Nations
                            forces and of the plan to assemble them in three beachheads in the
                            Seoul–Inchon, Hamhung and Pusan areas. <del rendition="#strikethrough"
                                >Inform</del>
