                        </item>
                        <label>2.</label>
                        <item>
                            <hi rendition="#underline">It would be militarily advantageous in the
                                immediate situation if a cease-fire order could be arranged provided
                                that considerations offered were not so great as to be unacceptable.
                                It might insure full support of the United Nations if it were done
                                on the basis of the 38th Parallel.</hi>
