                            <hi rendition="#underline">including</hi> efforts which could be made to
                            stimulate anticommunist resistance within China itself, <del
                                rendition="#strikethrough">including</del>
                            <hi rendition="#underline">such as</hi> the exploitation of Nationalist
                                capabilities<hi rendition="#underline">, imposition of a naval
